---
<section class="bio" id="about" aria-labelledby="bio-label">
    <div class="bio__inner">
        <div class="bio__label">
            <div id="bio-label">BIO</div>
            <div class="bio__sub">→ 002</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bio__body">
            <p>
                Vikram Hegde. Frontend engineer based in Bangalore. Writes
                React, fights with CSS, ships small libraries, and redesigns
                this site on a quarterly basis.
            </p>
            <p class="bio__muted">
                Currently obsessed with intrinsic web design, container
                queries, and the small interactions that make a product feel
                considered. TypeScript by day, plain HTML by preference.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .bio {
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
        container-type: inline-size;
    }

    .bio__inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: stretch;
    }

    .bio__label {
        width: 200px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        padding: 24px;
        border-right: 2px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .bio__sub {
        opacity: 0.5;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    .bio__body {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 24px var(--wrapper-padding);
        display: flex;
        gap: 40px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .bio__body p {
        flex: 1;
    }

    .bio__muted {
        opacity: 0.65;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    @container (max-width: 720px) {
        .bio__inner {
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .bio__label {
            width: 100%;
            border-right: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
            flex-direction: row;
            gap: 16px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .bio__body {
            flex: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .bio__body p {
            flex: none;
        }
    }
</style>
